= Assasination of Liao Zhongkai

After the tough struggle between Liao Zhongkai, Wang Jingwei and Hu Hanmin began, no one expected violence to occur.
  
This seemed to be wrong, as Liao Zhongkai was assasinated by five gunmen before an executive meeting. Condolences were given to the family but many began suspecting the Right faction.

Although his beliefs may have differed from others, this is still an unfortunate thing to happen for us.

